            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Fixed CueNow disappearing when another application's menu bar item is changed
  in System Settings. ChatGPT, Cursor, Claude, and other applications now affect
  only their own icons.
- Turning CueNow off in System Settings now hides only CueNow. Turning it back on
  restores it without quitting the app.
- Preserves CueNow's existing menu bar position while moving it to a stable,
  app-owned menu bar identity.
]]></description>
