            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CueNow 1.4.52

## Fixes

- Fixed the CueNow menu bar icon disappearing after changing other apps' menu
  bar settings on macOS 26.
- CueNow now uses one standard 22-point menu bar slot instead of reserving a
  43-point variable-width slot, so macOS no longer pushes it out while
  rearranging a crowded menu bar.
]]></description>
